  "title": "MMS and Hafnia Seafarer Forum 2026",
  "summary": "Hafnia and MMS successfully concluded the MMS Hafnia Forum 2026 in Gurugram, Delhi. The forum brought together 73 participants including seafarers, MMS onshore team members from Tokyo, Singapore, Delhi and Mumbai, Hafnia onshore team members, and a DNV representative. The event opened with a strong focus on safety, covering Bridge Resource Management, human factors, situational awareness, and command presence during critical […]",
